        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "0c6a1acf-8ae6-3954-a478-fdf3b0c1149a",
                "word": "eerbaarheid",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7a4d931d-4f98-3873-b777-fb602f95dbbe",
                        "entry_id": "0c6a1acf-8ae6-3954-a478-fdf3b0c1149a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "kuisheid en reinheid op seksueel gebied (met name van de vrouw)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c1ef6e91-6ca3-4325-b3a2-52b879de2937",
                                "sense_id": "7a4d931d-4f98-3873-b777-fb602f95dbbe",
                                "text": "De eerste keer was een meisje van 15 jaar ongewild getuige, een week later een even oud meisje. De derde keer schrokken agenten van wat ze zagen en maakten ze foto's. Hij wordt vervolgd voor het schenden van de eerbaarheid."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "74802b95-4dcb-4be7-9b80-51152aea6b40",
                                "sense_id": "7a4d931d-4f98-3873-b777-fb602f95dbbe",
                                "text": "Volgens advocaat Joris van 't Hoff is de wet simpel: Op het moment dat iemand de kerk binnenkomt en het ziet, kan er sprake zijn van schennis van de eerbaarheid.'Aangezien niemand getuige was van de heimelijke opname in de Tilburgse kerk, is het geen strafbaar feit. Het OM vindt daarom een civiele zaak meer op zijn plaats. De Sint Jozefkerk aarzelt, maar laat een beslissing over vervolgstappen aan het bisdom."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "78763cb9-4a34-3856-86ef-6e0e98cf0c82",
                        "entry_id": "0c6a1acf-8ae6-3954-a478-fdf3b0c1149a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "netheid en reinheid op andere gebieden"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "afb512f3-f7cf-4ec9-b553-68363cc0664e",
                                "sense_id": "78763cb9-4a34-3856-86ef-6e0e98cf0c82",
                                "text": "In het kader van hun activiteiten nemen de leden van de Koninklijke Familie deel aan de vergaderingen of openbare bijeenkomsten waarvoor hun aanwezigheid of hun medewerking wordt gevraagd, voor zover deze deelname geen afbreuk doet aan de waardigheid en de eerbaarheid van hun functies, en hun neutraliteit niet in het gedrang dreigt te brengen."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "be949a68-fa6b-4ce7-a443-0a9ef8bc669f",
                        "source_entry_id": "0c6a1acf-8ae6-3954-a478-fdf3b0c1149a",
                        "source_sense_id": "78763cb9-4a34-3856-86ef-6e0e98cf0c82",
                        "source_sense_description": "netheid en reinheid op andere gebieden",
                        "target_lang_word": "decency",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "decency",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d8322bb3-b599-3175-905a-360ea541d5d6",
                                        "entry_id": "72ca3f99-94d3-30d2-9b24-633cfd3ff10a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being decent; propriety."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "051970cb-3611-4096-846f-ef4f94b1f4b0",
                                                "sense_id": "d8322bb3-b599-3175-905a-360ea541d5d6",
                                                "text": "Immodest words admit of no defence, / For want of decency is want of sense."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0d5ba28-361b-47b0-a482-aa8f391d87b9",
                                                "sense_id": "d8322bb3-b599-3175-905a-360ea541d5d6",
                                                "text": "Indeed it is for the moſt part in our ſkill in manners, and in the obſervances of time and place, and of decency in general, which is only to be learned in thoſe ſchools to which Horace recommends us, that what is called Taſte by way of diſtinction, conſiſts; and which is in reality no other than a more refined judgment."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a0957a6-48bf-469a-b4cc-5878ecadaacb",
                                                "sense_id": "d8322bb3-b599-3175-905a-360ea541d5d6",
                                                "text": "[To Joseph McCarthy:] Have you no sense of decency, sir? At long last, have you left no sense of decency?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d26357c-1ffb-43a5-8984-92b1f5edfece",
                                                "sense_id": "d8322bb3-b599-3175-905a-360ea541d5d6",
                                                "text": "Now, what is interesting about that poem is nothing. But, what is relevant about it is that his muse is his wife, Marcela, who is 42 years younger than him. He is 75, she is 33. And I’ll say this, at least when 70-something American politicians get creepily handsy with 30-something women, they have the decency to do so with their own daughters. Have some class, Brazil! Have some class!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9201ca7d-1269-3d8a-ab4a-a2da0804b0e8",
                                        "entry_id": "72ca3f99-94d3-30d2-9b24-633cfd3ff10a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That which is proper or becoming."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f7f14e7-5d7e-456b-8985-05261906e841",
                                                "sense_id": "9201ca7d-1269-3d8a-ab4a-a2da0804b0e8",
                                                "text": "Those thousand decencies, that daily flow / From all her words and actions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5f2005d-65b5-4bab-8fe3-7a36b6be224c",
                                                "sense_id": "9201ca7d-1269-3d8a-ab4a-a2da0804b0e8",
                                                "text": "'Tis in the Civil Government, as in the Offices of Religion; which, were they ſtript of all the External Decencies of Worſhip, would not make a due Impreſſion on the Minds of thoſe who aſſiſt at them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fdfd7ea3-219d-40bf-9f79-de89b6d8c917",
                        "source_entry_id": "0c6a1acf-8ae6-3954-a478-fdf3b0c1149a",
                        "source_sense_id": "78763cb9-4a34-3856-86ef-6e0e98cf0c82",
                        "source_sense_description": "netheid en reinheid op andere gebieden",
                        "target_lang_word": "respectability",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "respectability",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "74b9b583-2c0f-3443-938f-27b9bb246b34",
                                        "entry_id": "baee8848-de7c-30ac-a54c-459dfc499af1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being respectable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ecbb8e90-ce9b-4646-946e-4912799e11a8",
                                                "sense_id": "74b9b583-2c0f-3443-938f-27b9bb246b34",
                                                "text": "Such a scandal as the prosecution of a brother for forgery—with a verdict of guilty—is a most truly horrible, deplorable, fatal thing. It takes the respectability out of a family perhaps at a critical moment, when the family is just assuming the robes of respectability: […] it is a black spot which all the soaps ever advertised could never wash off."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59f16d70-5d03-4643-861e-79c070b1b44e",
                                                "sense_id": "74b9b583-2c0f-3443-938f-27b9bb246b34",
                                                "text": "But once again Hodgson's men found a way to get the result they required and there is a real air of respectability about their campaign even though they had to survive a first-half siege from a Ukraine side desperate for the win they needed to progress."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "950908c6-af2d-3809-bfe1-ac471473ec19",
                                        "entry_id": "baee8848-de7c-30ac-a54c-459dfc499af1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The class of respectable people."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "73b0d30a-c182-46a8-9afd-30b49a78e8ef",
                        "source_entry_id": "0c6a1acf-8ae6-3954-a478-fdf3b0c1149a",
                        "source_sense_id": "78763cb9-4a34-3856-86ef-6e0e98cf0c82",
                        "source_sense_description": "netheid en reinheid op andere gebieden",
